# Design

Default is a clean **white/light** UI with optional **dark** theme. Theme preference is stored in `localStorage` key `lu4-rb-theme`.

## Do

- Light theme by default; dark via toggle (sun/moon)
- Larger base typography (comfortable on 2K monitors)
- Brand «LU4-RB» prominent on login and header
- Keep the RB table as the main surface after login
- Kill time UI: hour + minute only, plus quick presets (now / 5m / 15m)

## Don't

- Gold-on-ink fantasy gradients as the default look
- Purple AI clichés, cream/terracotta newspaper look
- Full datetime pickers when only clock time is needed
